---

<BaseLayout title="Resume" sideBarActiveItemID="resume">
  <!-- Toolbar (screen only) -->
  <div class="mb-6 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 print:hidden">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">Resume</h1>
    <a href="/resume/print?auto=1" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Save as PDF</a>
  </div>

  <article class="resume bg-white text-[#111827] shadow-xl rounded-lg p-10 print:p-0 print:shadow-none print:rounded-none">
    <!-- HEADER -->
    <header class="mb-5">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between gap-3">
        <div>
          <h2 class="serif font-semibold text-[28px] leading-tight text-[#0F2A4A]">Danish Siddique</h2>
          <p class="serif italic text-[12.5px] text-[#525252] mt-0.5">Senior Software Engineer</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-[3px] text-[10.5px] text-[#525252] md:items-end">
          {
            contacts.map((c) =>
              c.href ? (
                <a href={c.href} class="resume-link flex items-center gap-1.5">
                  <svg
                    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                    class="w-[11px] h-[11px] flex-shrink-0"
                    fill="currentColor"
                    aria-hidden="true"
                  >
                    <path d={c.path} />
                  </svg>
                  <span>{c.text}</span>
                </a>
              ) : (
                <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                  <svg
                    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                    class="w-[11px] h-[11px] flex-shrink-0"
                    fill="currentColor"
                    aria-hidden="true"
                  >
                    <path d={c.path} />
                  </svg>
                  <span>{c.text}</span>
                </span>
              )
            )
          }
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <hr class="border-[#E5E5E5] mb-4" />

    <!-- SUMMARY -->
    <section class="mb-5">
      <p class="text-[12px] leading-[1.55] text-[#1f2937]">
        Senior AI Engineer &amp; Full-Stack Developer with 5+ years building production software used
        by thousands. At <span class="font-medium text-[#0F2A4A]">Kindred</span> (formerly Mynd),
        led the development of an AI-powered platform serving 200+ therapists, including automated
        note-taking, intelligent chat assistants, and AI workflows that handle support tickets and
        bug reports automatically. Comfortable owning products end-to-end, from architecture to
        launch, across modern web technologies (Node.js, Django, React, AWS), and a heavy user of
        AI-assisted development tools like Claude Code and Cursor.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- EXPERIENCE -->
    <section class="mb-5">
      <h3 class="section-label">Experience</h3>

      <div class="mb-4 print:break-inside-avoid">
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2">
          <div class="serif font-semibold text-[13.5px] text-[#111827]">
            Kindred <span class="font-normal text-[#525252]">(formerly Mynd)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-[10.5px] text-[#525252] whitespace-nowrap">Sept 2023 – Present · Remote</div>
        </div>
        <div class="italic text-[11.5px] text-[#374151] mb-0.5">Senior Full-Stack Engineer</div>
        <div class="mono text-[9.5px] text-[#525252] mb-1.5">
          TypeScript · Node.js · Django · AWS Lambda · React · LangChain · Goose · Inngest · LiveKit · Deepgram
        </div>
        <ul class="list-disc ml-4 text-[11.5px] leading-[1.45] space-y-1 text-[#1f2937]">
          <li>Currently shipping <b>Kindred Workplace</b>, an emotional-intelligence platform for teams. Own product engineering across React, Node.js (TypeScript), and Django, including embedded AI features.</li>
          <li>Built <b>Kindred Practice (formerly Mynd)</b>, an AI-driven practice management platform for therapists. Scaled to 1,000+ users. Owned scheduling, billing, clinical documentation, and AI features end-to-end.</li>
          <li>Shipped <b>developer-loop automations</b> across the engineering org. Sentry incidents and Gleap support tickets route through <b>Goose</b> agents that reproduce, implement, and open ready-to-review pull requests, cutting incident-to-fix time substantially.</li>
          <li>Built a <b>universal in-app AI agent</b> capable of executing arbitrary product actions through tool calls, with structured outputs, scoped permissions, and per-call guardrails.</li>
          <li>Deployed multiple <b>production RAG pipelines</b> across clinical context, customer support, and internal knowledge surfaces. Pgvector storage, custom chunking strategies, eval-driven iteration.</li>
          <li>Treat AI as core engineering infrastructure: authored team-wide <b>Cursor rules</b> and <b>Claude Code</b> skills encoding Kindred's codebase conventions, sustaining ~2–3× shipping velocity on new features and cutting new-hire ramp from weeks to days.</li>
          <li>Designed event-driven backend on Node.js (TypeScript), Django, and AWS Lambda. Integrated real-time video, transcription, and chat via LiveKit, AWS Chime, and Deepgram.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="mb-4 print:break-inside-avoid">
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2">
          <div class="serif font-semibold text-[13.5px] text-[#111827]">Extendly</div>
          <div class="text-[10.5px] text-[#525252] whitespace-nowrap">Apr 2023 – May 2024 · Remote</div>
        </div>
        <div class="italic text-[11.5px] text-[#374151] mb-0.5">Full-Stack Developer</div>
        <div class="mono text-[9.5px] text-[#525252] mb-1.5">
          Python · OpenAI · FastAPI · PostgreSQL · React · AWS Lambda
        </div>
        <ul class="list-disc ml-4 text-[11.5px] leading-[1.45] space-y-1 text-[#1f2937]">
          <li>Built a <b>RAG-powered customer support chatbot</b> on OpenAI, FastAPI, and PostgreSQL. Improved response accuracy and significantly reduced manual support load.</li>
          <li>Designed and shipped cross-platform React interfaces for the SaaS product.</li>
          <li>Integrated third-party APIs into SaaS workflows on AWS Lambda using a serverless architecture, enabling automation and data sync across platforms.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="mb-2 print:break-inside-avoid">
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2">
          <div class="serif font-semibold text-[13.5px] text-[#111827]">Zaytrics Pvt Ltd</div>
          <div class="text-[10.5px] text-[#525252] whitespace-nowrap">Sep 2020 – Apr 2023 · Islamabad</div>
        </div>
        <div class="italic text-[11.5px] text-[#374151] mb-0.5">Full-Stack Developer</div>
        <div class="mono text-[9.5px] text-[#525252] mb-1.5">
          Node.js · React · Flask · PostgreSQL · MongoDB · TensorFlow
        </div>
        <ul class="list-disc ml-4 text-[11.5px] leading-[1.45] space-y-1 text-[#1f2937]">
          <li>Built an <b>ML-based trademark infringement detection</b> system on logos. Reached 85%+ accuracy. Reduced manual review effort by ~70%.</li>
          <li>Delivered multiple applications across Node.js, React, Flask, and PostgreSQL for legal and marketing automation.</li>
          <li>Refactored PostgreSQL and MongoDB databases. Improved query performance and scalability under growing data loads.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SELECTED PROJECTS -->
    <section class="mb-5 print:break-inside-avoid">
      <h3 class="section-label">Selected Projects</h3>
      <div class="text-[11.5px] leading-[1.5] space-y-1.5 text-[#1f2937]">
        <div>
          <span class="serif font-semibold">Kindred Workplace</span>
          <span class="mono text-[10px] text-[#525252]"> · </span>
          <a href="https://kindredworkplace.com" class="resume-link text-[10.5px]">kindredworkplace.com</a>
          <div class="text-[#374151]">Emotional-intelligence platform for teams. Full-stack delivery, real-time features, and embedded AI.</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="serif font-semibold">Kindred Practice</span>
          <span class="mono text-[10px] text-[#525252]"> · </span>
          <a href="https://kindredpractice.com" class="resume-link text-[10.5px]">kindredpractice.com</a>
          <span class="text-[10.5px] text-[#525252]"> (formerly mynd.app)</span>
          <div class="text-[#374151]">AI-powered practice management platform for therapists. Video, automated note-taking, RAG-based chat, scheduling, billing.</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="serif font-semibold">Developer-Loop Automations</span>
          <span class="text-[10.5px] text-[#525252]"> · internal · Goose-based agents</span>
          <div class="text-[#374151]">Sentry incidents and Gleap tickets routed to Goose agents that scope, implement, and open pull requests.</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="serif font-semibold">Medimap</span>
          <span class="mono text-[10px] text-[#525252]"> · </span>
          <a href="https://medimap.ca" class="resume-link text-[10.5px]">medimap.ca</a>
          <div class="text-[#374151]">Healthcare platform helping patients find nearby walk-in clinics and providers in real time.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SKILLS -->
    <section class="mb-5 print:break-inside-avoid">
      <h3 class="section-label">Skills</h3>
      <div class="text-[11.5px] leading-[1.55] space-y-1 text-[#1f2937]">
        <div><span class="font-semibold text-[#0F2A4A]">Languages</span> · TypeScript, Python, JavaScript</div>
        <div><span class="font-semibold text-[#0F2A4A]">Backend</span> · Node.js, Django, FastAPI, Flask, Fastify</div>
        <div><span class="font-semibold text-[#0F2A4A]">Frontend</span> · React, Vue, Tailwind CSS, Chakra UI</div>
        <div><span class="font-semibold text-[#0F2A4A]">Data</span> · PostgreSQL, MongoDB, DynamoDB, Elasticsearch, pgvector</div>
        <div><span class="font-semibold text-[#0F2A4A]">Cloud</span> · AWS (Lambda, Chime), GCP</div>
        <div><span class="font-semibold text-[#0F2A4A]">AI stack</span> · Claude Code, Cursor, Goose, MCP, LangChain, Inngest, GPT, Gemini, RAG, vector search, evals, Deepgram, LiveKit</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- EDUCATION -->
    <section class="print:break-inside-avoid">
      <h3 class="section-label">Education</h3>
      <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2 text-[11.5px]">
        <div>
          <span class="serif font-semibold text-[#111827]">BS Computer Science</span>,
          <span class="text-[#374151]">Air University</span>,
          <span class="text-[#525252]">Islamabad, Pakistan</span>
        </div>
        <div class="text-[10.5px] text-[#525252] whitespace-nowrap">Sep 2017 – Jun 2021</div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>


<style is:global>
  .resume {
    font-family: "Inter", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
    font-feature-settings: "ss01", "cv11";
  }
  .resume .serif {
    font-family: "Newsreader", ui-serif, Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  }
  .resume .mono {
    font-family: "JetBrains Mono", ui-monospace, "Cascadia Code", Consolas, monospace;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }
  .resume .section-label {
    font-family: "Newsreader", ui-serif, Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: #0F2A4A;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #E5E5E5;
    padding-bottom: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .resume .resume-link {
    color: #0F2A4A;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
    transition: border-color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .resume .resume-link:hover {
    border-bottom-color: #0F2A4A;
  }

  @media print {
    @page {
      size: letter;
      margin: 0.5in;
    }

    /* Reset html/body */
    html, body {
      background: white !important;
      color: #111827 !important;
      margin: 0 !important;
      padding: 0 !important;
      width: 100% !important;
    }

    /* Hide all chrome: drawer sidebar, mobile header, footer, toolbar */
    .drawer-side,
    .drawer-overlay,
    .navbar,
    body > div > div > header,
    body footer,
    .print\:hidden {
      display: none !important;
    }

    /* Flatten the drawer/main containers so the resume can flow full width */
    .drawer,
    .drawer-content,
    main {
      display: block !important;
      padding: 0 !important;
      margin: 0 !important;
      max-width: none !important;
      width: 100% !important;
      background: white !important;
      box-shadow: none !important;
      overflow: visible !important;
    }

    /* The resume itself */
    .resume {
      background: white !important;
      color: #111827 !important;
      padding: 0 !important;
      margin: 0 !important;
      box-shadow: none !important;
      border-radius: 0 !important;
      max-width: none !important;
      width: 100% !important;
      position: static !important;
    }

    /* Force ALL color/background to print (otherwise Chrome strips bg/colors) */
    .resume, .resume * {
      -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact !important;
      print-color-adjust: exact !important;
    }

    /* Make sure the navy accent shows up in print */
    .resume a, .resume .resume-link {
      color: #0F2A4A !important;
      text-decoration: none !important;
    }

    /* Avoid awkward page breaks */
    .resume section,
    .resume header,
    .resume ul,
    .resume li {
      page-break-inside: avoid;
      break-inside: avoid;
    }

    /* Don't append URLs after every link */
    a[href]::after { content: "" !important; }
  }
</style>
